        "original_id": "e1888395-6d3c-5cfc-96c7-217bf35c26aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\", \"Love at First Sting\"\n- People: Klaus Meine, Herman Rarebell, Rudolf Schenker\n- Organizations: Scorpions\n- Topics: songwriting, album releases, lyrics\n\nFacts:\n- In 1984, \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\" was released as the lead single from \"Love at First Sting\".\n- \"Love at First Sting\" is the ninth studio album by the German hard rock band Scorpions.\n- Klaus Meine and Herman Rarebell wrote \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\".\n- Rudolf Schenker composed \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\".\n- The lyrics of \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\" reference the title of the album \"Love at First Sting\".\n- \"Love at First Sting\" contains \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\", \"Still Loving You\", and \"Big City Nights\", three of Scorpions' most famous songs.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "22ca4dd4-a4c8-5ec2-af73-ce60fe64feb0",
        "text": "Page: Rock You Like a Hurricane. Sentence: The song was released as the lead single from their ninth studio album, \"Love at First Sting\" (1984).\nPage: Rock You Like a Hurricane. Sentence: It was written by Klaus Meine and Herman Rarebell, and composed by Rudolf Schenker.\nPage: Rock You Like a Hurricane. Sentence: The lyrics of \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\" also reference the title of the album on which it originally appeared – \"Love at First Sting\".\nPage: Love at First Sting. Sentence: Love at First Sting is the ninth studio album by German hard rock band Scorpions.\nPage: Love at First Sting. Sentence: The album contains \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\", \"Still Loving You\", and \"Big City Nights\", three of the band's most famous songs.",
